Redistribution of the ZeroClaw base image
=========================================

Published nilchela images are built FROM:

  ghcr.io/zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw:v0.8.5-debian

that is, the `debian` variant of https://github.com/zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw at
tag v0.8.5. The tag is parameterised by ARG ZEROCLAW_VERSION in the Dockerfile.
That image is redistributed as part of nilchela, which is why the ZeroClaw
notice above is reproduced in full rather than merely linked.

